WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.833 --> 00:00:06.400
Ta-da!

2
00:00:06.466 --> 00:00:09.500
- Fenn!
- Pan! Pancham!

3
00:00:09.566 --> 00:00:11.400
- Wow!
- Pika!

4
00:00:11.466 --> 00:00:14.866
- Denne! Denne-ne!
- That dress is so pretty!

5
00:00:14.933 --> 00:00:16.700
She's right. It looks super!

6
00:00:16.766 --> 00:00:19.000
The Pokémon Showcase. It's your first.

7
00:00:19.066 --> 00:00:20.933
Yeah!

8
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:22.800
♪ You're just a kid on a quest ♪

9
00:00:22.866 --> 00:00:24.566
♪ To be the best of the best ♪

10
00:00:24.633 --> 00:00:28.000
♪ Someday you're destined for power and glory ♪

11
00:00:28.066 --> 00:00:29.466
♪ You know you're up to the test ♪

12
00:00:29.533 --> 00:00:33.300
♪ There's only one way to tell this story ♪

13
00:00:33.366 --> 00:00:36.566
♪ Be a hero! Be a hero! ♪

14
00:00:36.633 --> 00:00:39.433
♪ All the power is at your command ♪

15
00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:43.966
♪ Face your fears and show you're a hero ♪

16
00:00:44.033 --> 00:00:48.666
♪ The future of the world is in your hand! ♪

17
00:00:48.733 --> 00:00:50.933
♪ Pokémon! ♪

18
00:00:53.633 --> 00:00:56.266
A Showcase Debut!

19
00:01:00.066 --> 00:01:04.366
Our heroes are continuing their stay in Coumarine City,

20
00:01:04.433 --> 00:01:08.766
because it's now time for Serena's Pokémon Showcase debut!

21
00:01:08.833 --> 00:01:11.633
-Where's registration?

22
00:01:11.700 --> 00:01:13.233
- There you are!
- Huh?

23
00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:15.733
-Shauna!

24
00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:16.833
Hey, Shauna!

25
00:01:16.900 --> 00:01:19.500
So you're in the Coumarine Pokémon Showcase, too.

26
00:01:19.566 --> 00:01:22.566
I can't stand by and let Serena win!

27
00:01:22.633 --> 00:01:24.966
Because from this point on, we're rivals, right?

28
00:01:25.033 --> 00:01:26.966
Huh? That's right.

29
00:01:27.033 --> 00:01:30.500
But there's no way I'm gonna lose.

30
00:01:30.566 --> 00:01:33.166
Hm...

31
00:01:33.233 --> 00:01:37.800
- Ha! I'm not going to lose, either. Hm!
- Hm!

32
00:01:42.533 --> 00:01:44.133
- Pretty cool place, huh?
- Pika!

33
00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:46.800
- Uh-huh.
- Kind of nerve-wracking, isn't it?

34
00:01:46.866 --> 00:01:50.833
I've done this once before, but I'm still nervous.

35
00:01:50.900 --> 00:01:54.266
Soon, this place is gonna be packed with people, right?

36
00:01:56.100 --> 00:01:59.300
And now, your future Kalos Queen...

37
00:01:59.366 --> 00:02:01.600
None other than me, Jessilee!

38
00:02:01.666 --> 00:02:03.533
You tell them, your Majesty!

39
00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:05.733
You're on the scene and everything's keen!

40
00:02:05.800 --> 00:02:09.600
With a keen grasp of the obvious. Come, loyal subjects!

41
00:02:09.666 --> 00:02:12.733
- Yes, Ma'am!
- Wobba, wobba!

42
00:02:14.366 --> 00:02:15.966
Huh?

43
00:02:21.133 --> 00:02:22.966
Right. I've got other rivals.

44
00:02:23.033 --> 00:02:25.466
Of course. Try not to get overwhelmed.

45
00:02:25.533 --> 00:02:27.866
She's right! Overwhelm them instead!

46
00:02:27.933 --> 00:02:29.300
-Huh?

47
00:02:29.366 --> 00:02:33.700
- Make way. Your queen is coming through.
- Cham?

48
00:02:33.766 --> 00:02:36.000
-I think they're waiting for her.

49
00:02:36.066 --> 00:02:37.133
- Come on.
- Oh, there she is.

50
00:02:37.200 --> 00:02:40.466
Palermo, we've arrived at the venue.

51
00:02:40.533 --> 00:02:44.233
- Do I really have to go through this?
- Yes, please.

52
00:02:44.300 --> 00:02:46.966
I'll have the limo pick you up in the morning.

53
00:02:48.800 --> 00:02:52.233
We've been expecting you. This way, please!

54
00:02:52.300 --> 00:02:56.566
Your feelings on returning to the Pokémon Showcase world as a judge, please?

55
00:02:56.633 --> 00:02:58.800
- We just need one second!
- Palermo?

56
00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:05.766
I wonder if Jessie will pull it off.

57
00:03:05.833 --> 00:03:09.233
No doubt. There isn't a spotlight she's not in love with.

58
00:03:09.300 --> 00:03:10.433
Wobba!

59
00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:14.033
- Can't wait, Pikachu. You, too?
- Pikachu!

60
00:03:14.100 --> 00:03:16.333
Let's make sure we cheer loudly for Serena.

61
00:03:16.400 --> 00:03:19.066
- Pan!
- Denne-ne-ne-ne!

62
00:03:19.133 --> 00:03:21.933
-Ha! Here we go...

63
00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:26.300
Bonjour, people of Kalos, devoted fans of Pokémon.

64
00:03:26.366 --> 00:03:29.233
The Coumarine Rookie Class Pokémon Festival Showcase,

65
00:03:29.300 --> 00:03:35.066
the Celebration of Beginnings, is about to begin, with grace and elegance!

66
00:03:36.766 --> 00:03:41.766
I will be your guide through this splendid dream world. Monsieur Pierre!

67
00:03:41.833 --> 00:03:46.266
I invite all of you at home, as well as here in the audience,

68
00:03:46.333 --> 00:03:50.833
to be part of a beauty unsurpassed anywhere else!

69
00:03:50.900 --> 00:03:55.033
No. There will never be another Kalos Queen like Aria.

70
00:03:55.100 --> 00:03:58.266
Our gifted performers and their Pokémon

71
00:03:58.333 --> 00:04:01.500
are sure to fill each and every one of your hearts

72
00:04:01.566 --> 00:04:04.766
with magnificence, awe and delight.

73
00:04:06.233 --> 00:04:07.966
Klefki! Key! Key, key!

74
00:04:08.033 --> 00:04:10.466
Hey. Do I know that Pokémon?

75
00:04:11.733 --> 00:04:13.800
Klefki. The Key Ring Pokémon.

76
00:04:13.866 --> 00:04:15.466
Klefki love to collect keys

77
00:04:15.533 --> 00:04:18.966
and will confront opponents with a fierce jingle of their collection.

78
00:04:19.033 --> 00:04:20.033
Key!

79
00:04:20.100 --> 00:04:22.033
- Cool!
- Pika!

80
00:04:22.100 --> 00:04:23.866
Merci, Klefki.

81
00:04:23.933 --> 00:04:29.233
And the winner of the Rookie Class will receive the coveted Princess Key!

82
00:04:29.300 --> 00:04:31.233
-Fenn, Fenn!

83
00:04:31.300 --> 00:04:34.833
- Aw! Isn't that quaint!
- Kaboo!

84
00:04:35.900 --> 00:04:39.800
Shauna, Jessilee, Alouette, you're all coming up next!

85
00:04:39.866 --> 00:04:40.833
Thanks!

86
00:04:40.900 --> 00:04:42.666
Off I go, Wish me luck.

87
00:04:42.733 --> 00:04:44.533
- Sure. Good luck, Shauna!
- Saur, saur!

88
00:04:44.600 --> 00:04:47.733
- That's our cue, Pumpkaboo.
- Kaboo!

89
00:04:47.800 --> 00:04:52.000
When a Pokémon performer wins three Princess Keys,

90
00:04:53.766 --> 00:04:56.900
she gets the opportunity to compete in the Master Class!

91
00:04:56.966 --> 00:04:57.966
Klefki!

92
00:04:58.033 --> 00:04:59.366
- So cool!
- Pika!

93
00:04:59.433 --> 00:05:03.766
And the winner of the prestigious Master Class will be crowned Kalos Queen,

94
00:05:03.833 --> 00:05:06.933
- in all of her glory and majesty!
- Klefki!

95
00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:09.166
Kalos Queen!

96
00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:14.100
So sit back and get ready as I take you by the hand

97
00:05:14.166 --> 00:05:18.566
and lead you to our Pokémon Showcase performances!

98
00:05:18.633 --> 00:05:22.333
And now, I present the Theme Performance for the first stage.

99
00:05:22.400 --> 00:05:26.000
And this exciting theme is...

100
00:05:26.066 --> 00:05:27.400
Magnifique!

101
00:05:27.466 --> 00:05:29.100
It's Pokémon Styling!

102
00:05:29.166 --> 00:05:32.100
Now, here are our first three performers.

103
00:05:35.233 --> 00:05:37.200
(cheering and applause)

104
00:05:37.266 --> 00:05:40.100
- Hello! Mwah! Mwah!
- Huh?

105
00:05:40.166 --> 00:05:42.566
Using our Pokémon Styling theme,

106
00:05:42.633 --> 00:05:47.133
performers will see who can best style their Pokémon at the height of fashion

107
00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:49.100
and all within ten minutes!

108
00:05:49.166 --> 00:05:54.600
However, only one out of our three performers will advance to the next stage.

109
00:05:54.666 --> 00:05:56.400
So it's a fashion show!

110
00:05:56.466 --> 00:05:58.833
Then there's nothing to worry about with Serena!

111
00:05:58.900 --> 00:06:01.166
This should be a walk in the park!

112
00:06:01.233 --> 00:06:02.900
No duh. She can't lose!

113
00:06:02.966 --> 00:06:05.466
All right, Pokémon performers.

114
00:06:05.533 --> 00:06:07.400
Are you all ready?

115
00:06:08.133 --> 00:06:12.000
It's time to style away, s'il vous plaît!

116
00:06:18.433 --> 00:06:20.200
Pokémon Styling!

117
00:06:20.266 --> 00:06:22.266
A performer's sense of style,

118
00:06:22.333 --> 00:06:26.366
combined with the chemistry between a performer and their Pokémon,

119
00:06:26.433 --> 00:06:28.033
is put to the test!

120
00:06:28.100 --> 00:06:31.966
You are witnessing a veritable performance fantastique!

121
00:06:32.033 --> 00:06:34.733
These performances extraordinaire...

122
00:06:34.800 --> 00:06:37.533
..as our competitors work with their Pokémon,

123
00:06:37.600 --> 00:06:40.066
are truly works of art in themselves!

124
00:06:42.533 --> 00:06:44.566
There are only a few minutes left.

125
00:06:44.633 --> 00:06:47.433
It's time for the secret finishing touches!

126
00:06:47.500 --> 00:06:50.433
In the blink of an eye, you will witness their work,

127
00:06:50.500 --> 00:06:53.433
unveiled and out on our runway!

128
00:06:54.500 --> 00:06:56.200
Time's up!

129
00:06:56.266 --> 00:06:58.533
And now, let's view their artistry.

130
00:06:58.600 --> 00:07:04.700
I call on Alouette and her Pokémon Furfrou to please proceed out here to the runway!

131
00:07:04.766 --> 00:07:06.500
Aah!

132
00:07:13.966 --> 00:07:20.866
Next up is performer Shauna and her Pokémon Bulbasaur!

133
00:07:20.933 --> 00:07:24.500
Aww.

134
00:07:24.566 --> 00:07:26.800
- Wow!
- Denne-ne, ne, ne!

135
00:07:26.866 --> 00:07:28.500
It looks just like a bouquet!

136
00:07:28.566 --> 00:07:30.466
Wow. Way to go, Shauna!

137
00:07:30.533 --> 00:07:34.966
Finally, we have performer Jessilee and her Pokémon Pumpkaboo!

138
00:07:35.033 --> 00:07:37.366
Key!

139
00:07:42.133 --> 00:07:44.266
Pumpkaboo!

140
00:07:44.333 --> 00:07:47.300
Presenting Beautiful and the Beast! Enjoy the view!

141
00:07:47.366 --> 00:07:50.600
- It's Beast Pumpkaboo!
- Kaboo!

142
00:07:50.666 --> 00:07:52.700
Yes! First prize, Jessilee!

143
00:07:52.766 --> 00:07:56.866
- You're the winner, you'll see!
- Wobbuffet!

144
00:07:56.933 --> 00:08:01.533
Now, ladies and gentlemen, you will be the judge!

145
00:08:01.600 --> 00:08:04.400
Please. Grab your glowsticks.

146
00:08:04.466 --> 00:08:05.933
He means this, right?

147
00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:07.066
Hm!

148
00:08:07.133 --> 00:08:10.433
When I give the signal, please light up your glowstick

149
00:08:10.500 --> 00:08:13.066
in the colour that corresponds with the performer

150
00:08:13.133 --> 00:08:16.866
who you have judged to be the crème de la crème.

151
00:08:16.933 --> 00:08:19.466
- Un, deux, trois!
- Aah!

152
00:08:19.533 --> 00:08:21.300
- Pika!

153
00:08:21.366 --> 00:08:23.800
- Pika!
- Oh! So pretty!

154
00:08:26.366 --> 00:08:28.800
That can't be! Who turned out my light?

155
00:08:31.866 --> 00:08:36.566
The performer who will be advancing to the next stage is...

156
00:08:36.633 --> 00:08:39.233
Shauna and her fabulous Bulbasaur!

157
00:08:39.299 --> 00:08:42.133
Bulbasaur, we did it!

158
00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:44.633
Bulba, Bulbasaur!

159
00:08:46.300 --> 00:08:47.800
Wow, Shauna did it!

160
00:08:47.866 --> 00:08:49.633
- Pancham, Pancham!
- Fennekin!

161
00:08:49.700 --> 00:08:51.133
Shauna's so awesome!

162
00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:56.700
Ridiculous!

163
00:08:56.766 --> 00:08:59.700
We're out of here, Pumpkaboo!

164
00:08:59.766 --> 00:09:02.733
- Pumpkaboo!
- I can't believe it!

165
00:09:02.800 --> 00:09:05.766
Uh-oh. This could be bad for our health.

166
00:09:05.833 --> 00:09:09.233
- Preventive measures time.
- Wobbuffet!

167
00:09:24.700 --> 00:09:26.366
Huh?

168
00:09:28.400 --> 00:09:31.066
You'll be great. Don't worry, Serena.

169
00:09:31.133 --> 00:09:33.400
Huh? Thanks a lot.

170
00:09:33.466 --> 00:09:36.066
- Blanche! Clarissa! Serena!
- Huh?

171
00:09:36.133 --> 00:09:38.300
Time to get ready! You're all up next!

172
00:09:38.366 --> 00:09:41.533
Right!

173
00:09:42.866 --> 00:09:45.800
And now we move on to our last trio.

174
00:09:49.533 --> 00:09:51.333
- There she is!
- Pika, pika!

175
00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:53.533
You can do it, Serena!

176
00:09:53.600 --> 00:09:56.700
I'm getting nervous, and I'm only in the audience!

177
00:09:58.300 --> 00:10:02.066
- Kin? Fennekin?
- Huh?

178
00:10:02.133 --> 00:10:06.133
That's right. I'm not alone. Fennekin is with me!

179
00:10:06.200 --> 00:10:09.933
Now. Let's take our first step towards our dream!

180
00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:12.966
Who's that Pokémon?

181
00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:19.066
It's Klefki!

182
00:10:19.133 --> 00:10:22.933
Klefki! Key! Key, key!

183
00:10:23.000 --> 00:10:27.933
All right. It's time to style away, s'il vous plaît.

184
00:10:33.600 --> 00:10:36.333
Hm. That and that!

185
00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:38.833
- OK! Hm.
- Kin?

186
00:10:38.900 --> 00:10:41.066
Huh? The pink one!

187
00:10:45.200 --> 00:10:47.266
Kin!

188
00:10:49.766 --> 00:10:51.900
- Fennekin?
- Fenne?

189
00:10:51.966 --> 00:10:55.566
We've been training hard for our performance today, haven't we?

190
00:10:58.466 --> 00:11:01.133
You know what Ash said. Remember?

191
00:11:01.200 --> 00:11:04.366
He said that nothing we ever do is a waste of time.

192
00:11:07.000 --> 00:11:10.900
And that means I'm going to use everything I've learned!

193
00:11:12.033 --> 00:11:16.033
Time for the secret finishing touches!

194
00:11:18.566 --> 00:11:20.700
There! You're all set, Fennekin.

195
00:11:22.766 --> 00:11:25.266
Of course that signals our time's up!

196
00:11:25.333 --> 00:11:27.233
Please proceed to the runway!

197
00:11:27.300 --> 00:11:29.633
And first up?

198
00:11:29.700 --> 00:11:32.933
Blanche and her Pokémon Meowstic!

199
00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:37.200
- Next up, Clarissa and Fletchling!
- And go!

200
00:11:37.266 --> 00:11:40.766
Last but not least, Serena and Fennekin!

201
00:11:40.833 --> 00:11:43.866
- Let's go.
- Fennekin!

202
00:11:50.233 --> 00:11:53.500
- Aw! That's the cutest thing!
- Awesome!

203
00:11:53.566 --> 00:11:55.033
- Great, you two!
- Pikachu!

204
00:11:55.100 --> 00:11:56.166
Ches, Chespin!

205
00:11:56.233 --> 00:11:58.200
- Cham!
- What an adorable look!

206
00:11:58.266 --> 00:11:59.266
Pancham!

207
00:12:03.533 --> 00:12:07.466
Fennekin? I think I'm having the most fun I've ever had!

208
00:12:07.533 --> 00:12:08.933
Kin!

209
00:12:18.766 --> 00:12:21.300
Fennekin!

210
00:12:23.500 --> 00:12:26.000
Kin! Fenn!

211
00:12:40.300 --> 00:12:43.166
And that's all for our Styling performance!

212
00:12:43.233 --> 00:12:47.166
Our Freestyle Performance is after the break!

213
00:12:47.233 --> 00:12:50.000
- Fenn...
- I'm sorry, Fennekin.

214
00:12:50.066 --> 00:12:51.400
Kin!

215
00:12:51.466 --> 00:12:54.866
- And Pancham? You, too.
- Cham, cham!

216
00:12:54.933 --> 00:12:58.300
- Serena...
- I guess I overdid it.

217
00:12:58.366 --> 00:13:02.466
I should have considered Fennekin walking next to me.

218
00:13:02.533 --> 00:13:05.966
You did a great job showing off Fennekin, though. Really!

219
00:13:07.066 --> 00:13:08.633
Thank you, Shauna.

220
00:13:08.700 --> 00:13:10.233
I'm going to get changed.

221
00:13:11.000 --> 00:13:13.733
I'm going to be cheering for you in the next round.

222
00:13:13.800 --> 00:13:16.666
- Thanks!
- Pan!

223
00:13:18.733 --> 00:13:23.066
And here we go. It's time for our exciting Freestyle Performance

224
00:13:23.133 --> 00:13:26.766
in which performer and Pokémon unite as one!

225
00:13:26.833 --> 00:13:28.166
Get ready!

226
00:13:28.233 --> 00:13:32.500
This is a one-of-a-kind stage. A combination of performance and skill!

227
00:13:32.566 --> 00:13:35.233
Each performer may use up to six Pokémon.

228
00:13:35.300 --> 00:13:38.800
And of course, the judge will be you, our audience!

229
00:13:38.866 --> 00:13:43.800
Relax and enjoy our Freestyle Performance!

230
00:13:54.400 --> 00:13:58.000
Next up, it's performer Shauna!

231
00:13:58.066 --> 00:13:59.966
- There she is!
- Pika, Pika!

232
00:14:04.100 --> 00:14:06.300
- Ready, Bulbasaur?
- Bulbasaur!

233
00:14:06.366 --> 00:14:08.466
- Flabébé?
- Bébé!

234
00:14:08.533 --> 00:14:10.633
Flabébé, Fairy Wind, go!

235
00:14:10.700 --> 00:14:13.366
And Bulbasaur, use Petal Dance!

236
00:14:13.433 --> 00:14:15.866
Bulbasaur!

237
00:14:20.933 --> 00:14:23.533
-She looks just like a fairy!

238
00:14:23.600 --> 00:14:24.600
Ne, ne!

239
00:14:27.166 --> 00:14:29.366
Bulbasaur, use Solar Beam!

240
00:14:29.433 --> 00:14:31.066
Bulbasaur!

241
00:14:50.500 --> 00:14:53.433
And now for our final tally!

242
00:14:53.500 --> 00:14:59.166
Which performer has gathered the most votes from you, the audience?

243
00:15:04.566 --> 00:15:10.000
It's performer Shauna! The Princess Key is yours!

244
00:15:10.066 --> 00:15:12.533
- All right!
- Bulbasaur!

245
00:15:14.133 --> 00:15:16.166
So cool. She won!

246
00:15:16.233 --> 00:15:18.700
- She did a really great job!
- Pika!

247
00:15:18.766 --> 00:15:22.600
- Shauna's one step ahead of me now.
- Fenn!

248
00:15:22.666 --> 00:15:24.200
Cham, cham!

249
00:15:25.666 --> 00:15:28.600
There. I watched all of it.

250
00:15:30.600 --> 00:15:34.400
That's it for the Rookie Class Pokémon Festival Showcase,

251
00:15:34.466 --> 00:15:36.966
the Celebration of Beginnings!

252
00:15:37.033 --> 00:15:38.800
Au revoir!

253
00:15:40.200 --> 00:15:42.533
- Congratulations, Shauna!
- Thanks, Serena!

254
00:15:42.600 --> 00:15:45.566
Just wait till Tierno and Trevor find out!

255
00:15:45.633 --> 00:15:49.066
Let me tell them, OK? I want to see the looks on their faces!

256
00:15:49.133 --> 00:15:50.000
Mm-hm!

257
00:15:50.066 --> 00:15:52.900
You'll see. I'll catch up to you in no time!

258
00:15:52.966 --> 00:15:56.233
Right! Let's both do our best to become Kalos Queen!

259
00:15:56.300 --> 00:15:59.800
Bye, you guys! I'll see you later! Bye!

260
00:15:59.866 --> 00:16:02.366
- Bye!
- Take care, Shauna!

261
00:16:02.433 --> 00:16:05.033
See you later! Pika!

262
00:16:05.100 --> 00:16:09.233
What do you say we all go and have dinner at the Pokémon Centre?

263
00:16:09.300 --> 00:16:11.066
Yay!

264
00:16:11.133 --> 00:16:12.600
- I'm so hungry!
- Me too.

265
00:16:12.666 --> 00:16:15.633
- I wonder if Serena will be all right.
- Pika.

266
00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:18.533
I'm sure she knows we all make mistakes, but still...

267
00:16:18.600 --> 00:16:21.033
- It's always fun with you.
- Serena will be fine.

268
00:16:21.100 --> 00:16:24.166
Don't forget, she's strong.

269
00:16:24.233 --> 00:16:25.533
Yeah, you're right.

270
00:16:27.966 --> 00:16:29.400
Of all the nerve.

271
00:16:29.466 --> 00:16:33.300
The people of Kalos must have awful taste, since they didn't vote for me.

272
00:16:33.366 --> 00:16:35.533
Next time, let's make it a group effort!

273
00:16:35.600 --> 00:16:37.966
Yeah! And your partner can be me!

274
00:16:38.033 --> 00:16:41.333
- Huh? Are you serious?
- You bet! I'm mad, too!

275
00:16:41.400 --> 00:16:44.166
All right, fasten your seatbelts!

276
00:16:44.233 --> 00:16:47.333
I'll rule Kalos as the queeniest queen you ever saw!

277
00:16:47.400 --> 00:16:50.933
-Wob, Wobbuffet!

278
00:16:52.533 --> 00:16:55.500
- All right, Ash. You're next!
- Huh?

279
00:16:55.566 --> 00:16:56.833
Going for your fifth badge.

280
00:16:56.900 --> 00:16:59.866
Wow. I'm going for my fifth badge already.

281
00:16:59.933 --> 00:17:01.900
Pika?

282
00:17:01.966 --> 00:17:05.133
Well, looks like the time has finally come.

283
00:17:05.200 --> 00:17:07.933
Oh, yeah. My next Gym Battle's against you!

284
00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:08.866
Pikachu!

285
00:17:08.933 --> 00:17:11.566
So, we'll head to Lumiose City. Great.

286
00:17:11.633 --> 00:17:16.133
- And let's give it all we've got, Pikachu!
- Pika, Pikachu!

287
00:17:18.133 --> 00:17:22.733
Yes... No... No one really thrilled me.

288
00:17:22.800 --> 00:17:25.833
Yes, I'll be ready at six a.m.

289
00:17:38.400 --> 00:17:40.333
- Cham?
- Fenn!

290
00:17:55.533 --> 00:17:58.233
- Fennekin! Fenn.
- Cham, cham? Pancham?

291
00:17:59.633 --> 00:18:01.300
- Fennekin.
- Cham, Pan?

292
00:18:05.933 --> 00:18:07.833
Kin! Fennekin!

293
00:18:07.900 --> 00:18:10.700
Pancham! Pancham! Cham, cham!

294
00:18:10.766 --> 00:18:14.066
- Fenn!
- Pancham! Cham.

295
00:18:14.133 --> 00:18:15.633
Oh, you.

296
00:18:26.100 --> 00:18:27.833
Huh?

297
00:18:29.266 --> 00:18:31.566
I'm sorry. It was all my fault.

298
00:18:31.633 --> 00:18:33.966
- Fennekin!
- Cham, cham!

299
00:18:34.033 --> 00:18:38.833
But you know what? You see, I've never felt like this before.

300
00:18:38.900 --> 00:18:41.800
Know why? I'm a performer now!

301
00:18:41.866 --> 00:18:46.333
I'm finally at the starting line of the race to my dream.

302
00:18:53.000 --> 00:18:55.600
Fenn?

303
00:18:55.666 --> 00:18:58.366
- Cham?
- Fenn?

304
00:19:01.166 --> 00:19:04.600
- Fenn! Fenn! Fenn!
- Cham! Cham! Cham!

305
00:19:05.500 --> 00:19:06.766
Cham?

306
00:19:06.833 --> 00:19:08.600
Hm!

307
00:19:30.466 --> 00:19:33.600
Palermo? Did you see anybody of interest?

308
00:19:33.666 --> 00:19:37.333
Hm... It's a secret.

309
00:19:40.766 --> 00:19:43.266
- Hey, where's Serena?
- Pika, pika!

310
00:19:43.333 --> 00:19:45.933
Now that's strange. She knows we're leaving soon.

311
00:19:46.000 --> 00:19:47.700
I'll go look.

312
00:19:49.366 --> 00:19:50.900
Ta-da!

313
00:19:52.633 --> 00:19:55.133
Sorry I'm late! What do you think?

314
00:19:58.033 --> 00:19:59.033
- Pancham, pan!
- Fennekin!

315
00:19:59.100 --> 00:20:00.400
-Pika!

316
00:20:00.466 --> 00:20:02.566
- Your hair!
- What in the world did you do?

317
00:20:02.633 --> 00:20:08.366
You chopped most of it off! Come on! I liked your long hair!

318
00:20:08.433 --> 00:20:11.133
Time for a change. I think it looks kind of cute.

319
00:20:11.200 --> 00:20:13.133
Yeah, I think so, too!

320
00:20:13.200 --> 00:20:15.066
Aw! Thank you, Ash!

321
00:20:15.133 --> 00:20:19.633
- Huh? Is that ribbon...
- Yeah. It's the present you gave me.

322
00:20:19.700 --> 00:20:23.133
- You're wearing it. Looks great!
- Pikachu!

323
00:20:25.333 --> 00:20:29.066
OK, let's go to Lumiose City! I'll race you there!

324
00:20:29.133 --> 00:20:31.200
Hey! It's my Gym Battle, you know!

325
00:20:31.266 --> 00:20:32.966
Yeah, against me!

326
00:20:33.033 --> 00:20:37.000
And so, with Serena's Pokémon Showcase debut behind her,

327
00:20:37.066 --> 00:20:40.700
our heroes' adventure begins as they head to Lumiose City!

328
00:20:40.766 --> 00:20:41.866
And next up?

329
00:20:41.933 --> 00:20:46.933
It's Ash's Gym Battle against Clemont, as the journey continues!
